Subject: [PATCH 8/8] Change the Cleanroom version from the Version page

Cleanroom installs as the net.minecraftforge component, so "Change
version" listed Forge versions and picking one replaced Cleanroom with
Forge.

On Cleanroom, "Change version" now lists the Cleanroom releases from
GitHub and installs the selected one the same way the Install Loader
dialog does (the same version can be installed again to repair an
instance). The button stays enabled even before the Forge list is
loaded. On Cleanroom's LWJGL 3 it explains that the LWJGL comes with
the Cleanroom version instead of offering LWJGL 2 versions.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019uQWuLEagQcA1VAuw2GCJd
